                     <handDesc>
                        <handNote n="v">
                           <seg xml:lang="fr">Il faut remarquer la rare ligature  entre le Υ et le Ι de υἱός. Un sceau du même personnage avec la légende Σφραγὶς Ἀνδρονίκου τοῦ Δούκα υἱοῦ τοῦ πανυπερσεβάστου, comportant
                              peut-être la même ligature (<ref target="https://www.doaks.org/resources/seals/byzantine-seals/BZS.1951.31.5.2014/view">BZS.1951.31.5.2014</ref>).</seg>
                           <seg xml:lang="en">Note the rare ligature  between the Υ and Ι in υἱός. A seal of the same person, bearing the legend Σφραγὶς Ἀνδρονικου τοῦ Δούκα υἱοῦ τοῦ πανυπερσεβάστου, may 
                              also feature the same ligature (Dumbarton Oaks Collection <ref target="https://www.doaks.org/resources/seals/byzantine-seals/BZS.1951.31.5.2014/view">BZS.1951.31.5.2014</ref>).</seg>
                                </handNote>
